sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant K as Keeper (any caller)
  participant OB as OrderBook
  participant T as Traders B1-B4, S1-S4
  Note over K,T: Before: each buyer's order hit the 10-fill cap and rested 1 NTU, crossed against older asks<br/>Bids: B1 @3.0, B2 @2.9, B3 @2.8, B4 @2.7<br/>Asks: S1, S2, S3, S4, 1 NTU each @2.0 (older bookSeq, so they are makers)
  K->>OB: matchOrders(10)
  activate OB
  OB->>T: Fill 1 at 2.0: 1 NTU to B1, 2.0 SGDx to S1, refund 1.0 to B1
  OB->>T: Fill 2 at 2.0: 1 NTU to B2, 2.0 SGDx to S2, refund 0.9 to B2
  OB->>T: Fill 3 at 2.0: 1 NTU to B3, 2.0 SGDx to S3, refund 0.8 to B3
  OB->>T: Fill 4 at 2.0: 1 NTU to B4, 2.0 SGDx to S4, refund 0.7 to B4
  Note over OB,T: both sides of the book now empty: not crossed, loop ends
  OB-->>K: returns 4 (4 Trade events)
  deactivate OB
  Note over K,T: 8 traders settled in ONE transaction. The keeper sends and receives no tokens.
